        "text": "your way with force. This is the universe's final message, so take it seriously."
      },
      {
        "start": 49.12,
        "end": 54.88,
        "text": "Now like this video. That will be your first seal. Save this post. That will be your second seal."
      },
      {
        "start": 54.88,
